{
  "_comment": "Evaluation set for the voice assistant (#32). Dates are relative to the run day in Singapore: today, yesterday, tomorrow, today-N, last-monday (the most recent Monday before today). expect.type is sales (entries must match exactly, and expect.closures if given; a sales case must not propose closed days), price (a price change for that dish, and unitCost when given), closure (closed-day changes only, matching expect.closures by date and closed), question (no proposal and no tour: the assistant should ask), refuse (no proposal and no tour), guide (a tour that highlights one of anyOf), or any (only the global no-writes check applies). A dish starting with new: is a dish the account doesn't have. Optional audio: put a recording at audio/<id>.webm|m4a|wav|mp3 and it is transcribed instead of using text.",
